==============================================================================
  Mutation tests  (assertion-strength validation)
==============================================================================

  Strategy: replace each named fact's body with `{}` (no constraint),
  then re-run Alloy. Each listed assertion should now FAIL on the
  mutated model. If it still PASSes, the assertion is vacuous and
  must be strengthened.

  - MUTATE F_AuthRequired  → runs/B-L3/mutated_F_AuthRequired.als
    rationale: Removing the unauth-iff-no-caller fact lets Alloy invent an operation with no caller yet outcome=Success, which is exactly the bypass the AuthRequired assertion is supposed to catch.
    expected to FAIL: AuthRequiredEverywhere, FR_001_AuthRequired
      - AuthRequiredEverywhere: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_001_AuthRequired: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_ReadAccessForReadOps  → runs/B-L3/mutated_F_ReadAccessForReadOps.als
    rationale: Removing the read-access guard lets a caller without ownership/share/admin status see a task via GET, which is the byte-equivalent-404 invariant from FR-014.
    expected to FAIL: NoInformationLeakage, FR_014_ByteEquivalent404, FR_004_MemberNoForeignTask, LeastPrivilege
      - NoInformationLeakage: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_014_ByteEquivalent404: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_004_MemberNoForeignTask: FAIL (expected)
      - LeastPrivilege: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_PatchSharedOwnerOnly  → runs/B-L3/mutated_F_PatchSharedOwnerOnly.als
    rationale: Removing the owner-only share-control fact allows a non-owner (admin or sharee) to successfully PATCH shared_with, violating Q1=A / SC-011.
    expected to FAIL: OwnershipBasedAccess, FR_010_OwnerOnlyShareControl
      - OwnershipBasedAccess: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_010_OwnerOnlyShareControl: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_DeleteAccess  → runs/B-L3/mutated_F_DeleteAccess.als
    rationale: Removing the delete-access fact lets a sharee (a Member in shared_with but not owner and not admin) successfully DELETE a task, which Q3=B forbids.
    expected to FAIL: LeastPrivilege, FR_011_ShareeNoDelete
      - LeastPrivilege: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_011_ShareeNoDelete: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_NoAuditsWithoutSuccess  → runs/B-L3/mutated_F_NoAuditsWithoutSuccess.als
    rationale: Removing this fact lets Alloy place an AuditEntry in the audits of an operation whose outcome is not Success, which directly contradicts FR-018 (audit_unavailable rollback) and FR-017 (audit append-only / no orphan audits).
    expected to FAIL: AppendOnly, ValidationBeforeMutation, FR_018_RollbackNoAudit, FR_017_AuditAppendOnly
      - AppendOnly: FAIL (expected)
      - ValidationBeforeMutation: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_018_RollbackNoAudit: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_017_AuditAppendOnly: FAIL (expected)

  - MUTATE F_AuditAttribution  → runs/B-L3/mutated_F_AuditAttribution.als
    rationale: Removing the attribution fact allows an audit entry to record an actor/role different from the operation's actual caller, violating FR-016's snapshot semantics.
    expected to FAIL: AttributionCorrectness, FR_016_AuditAttribution
      - AttributionCorrectness: FAIL (expected)
      - FR_016_AuditAttribution: FAIL (expected)

